{"title": "Absolute's Tempest", "pageid": 28548, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Absolute's_Tempest", "categories": ["Passive item features", "Bugs", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Absolute's Tempest</b> is a passive feature that adds 1 extra damage to thunder spells and attacks.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>If the wearer bears the <a href=\"/wiki/Brand_of_the_Absolute\" title=\"Brand of the Absolute\">Absolute's Brand</a>, they deal <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-thunder\">1 additional Thunder damage</span> with Thunder damage spells and attacks. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the equipment:</p><ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-uncommon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ring_of_Absolute_Force\" title=\"Ring of Absolute Force\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a3/Ring_of_Absolute_Force_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Ring_of_Absolute_Force_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a3/Ring_of_Absolute_Force_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Ring_of_Absolute_Force_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a3/Ring_of_Absolute_Force_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Ring_of_Absolute_Force_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a3/Ring_of_Absolute_Force_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Ring_of_Absolute_Force_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a3/Ring_of_Absolute_Force_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Ring_of_Absolute_Force\" title=\"Ring of Absolute Force\">Ring of Absolute Force</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>Absolute's Tempest functions even if the wearer is not <a href=\"/wiki/Brand_of_the_Absolute\" title=\"Brand of the Absolute\">branded</a>, but does not function with spells such as <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Booming_Blade\" title=\"Booming Blade\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Booming_Blade_Icon.webp/20px-Booming_Blade_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Booming_Blade_Icon.webp/30px-Booming_Blade_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Booming_Blade_Icon.webp/40px-Booming_Blade_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Booming Blade\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Booming_Blade_Icon.webp/20px-Booming_Blade_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Booming_Blade_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Booming_Blade\" title=\"Booming Blade\">Booming Blade</a> and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Thunderous_Smite\" title=\"Thunderous Smite\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/dd/Thunderous_Smite_Icon.webp/20px-Thunderous_Smite_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/dd/Thunderous_Smite_Icon.webp/30px-Thunderous_Smite_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/dd/Thunderous_Smite_Icon.webp/40px-Thunderous_Smite_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Thunderous Smite\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/dd/Thunderous_Smite_Icon.webp/20px-Thunderous_Smite_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/dd/Thunderous_Smite_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Thunderous_Smite\" title=\"Thunderous Smite\">Thunderous Smite</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/Difficulty#Honour_mode\" title=\"Difficulty\">Honour Mode</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>  \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202542\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.038 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.043 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1348/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 11424/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 4069/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 25/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.014/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 928543/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   37.600      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   37.600      1 -total\n 44.31%   16.660      1 Template:Passive_equipment_list\n 38.99%   14.661      1 Template:Passive_sources/format\n 36.44%   13.703      1 Template:MdRarityItem\n 19.27%    7.246      1 Template:Item_icon\n 14.46%    5.436      2 Template:SmSAI\n 10.48%    3.939      1 Template:PageSeo\n  9.70%    3.646      1 Template:Hidden_code\n  9.69%    3.644      2 Template:Icon_link\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:28548-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714202542 and revision id 371016. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}